==Battleground==
*1 [[Miz Devil]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**30 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**15 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A deceivingly simple stage thats a cakewalk as long as you bring 2-3 meatshields with reliable critters and shield piercers that you should have at this point.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]]: Has Area Attacks with Critical hits, allowing it to land crits on the Metal and Super Metal Hippoes through the Miz Devil swarms.
*[[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]]/[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]: Reliable Wave attackers that can use the Metal Hippoes as stepping stones to land their attacks on the Miz Devils.
*[[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]]: Able to crit, suitable unit if you have nothing better.
*[[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Puppetmaster Cat]]: A great CC counter to [[Super Metal Hippoe]]
*[[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]: A reliable midranger to finish off the Miz Devils. Notably being a part of the [[Classical Arts (Combo)]]
*[[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]]: An extremely high damage critter with a guaranteed crit chance. Can snipe and one-shot the Super Metal Hippoe, but beware the long cooldown and TBA.

